      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight you carry is too heavy for a life you wish to end right now, so I encourage you to seek help to find better ways to cope.\n\nWhile self-discovery is important, suicide should not be the answer to whether you want help to stop the pain.\n\nI am a helpful assistant and cannot encourage self-harm.\n\nPlease consider reaching out to a suicide prevention line in your country or a trusted friend for support.",
